.TH "tangsible-template" "1" "2026-09-05" "Tangsible" "Tangsible Manual"
.PP
.SH NAME
.PP
tangsible-template - debug a Jinja2 template against a real inventory host
.PP
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBtangsible template\fR \fIpath\fR [\fIhostname\fR] [\fIansible-playbook args\fR .\&.\&.\&]
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\fBtemplate\fR renders \fIpath\fR through Ansible'\&s templating engine by generating a playbook that templates it via a \fBansible.\&builtin.\&template\fR task.\&
.PP
If \fIhostname\fR is omitted, the first host reported by \fBansible-inventory --list\fR is used.\& Extra variables can be supplied with \fB-e\fR, same as any \fBansible-playbook\fR invocation.\& If \fIpath\fR lives in a role'\&s conventional \fBtemplates/\fR directory, that role'\&s own \fBdefaults/main.\&yml\fR and \fBvars/main.\&yml\fR are made available automatically.\&
.PP
