.SH EXIT STATUS
.PP
\fB0\fR
.RS 4
Normal exit, however the view was closed.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB1\fR
.RS 4
\fIpath\fR couldn'\&t be read, no host could be resolved from the inventory, or a scratch file this view depends on internally couldn'\&t be created.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB2\fR
.RS 4
Usage error: no \fIpath\fR was given.\&
.PP
.RE
